<BaseLayout title="About | Sudo Create" description="Sudo Create is an independent software development studio for creative businesses and creative people.">
  <header class="page-hero"><div class="shell"><span class="eyebrow">About the studio</span><h1 class="display">Creative instincts.<br/>Working-class follow-through.</h1><p>Sudo Create is a small software studio for people who care about how things work and how they feel.</p></div></header>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell founder-grid"><div class="portrait-frame"><img src="/headshot.jpg" alt="Shawn Papineau, founder of Sudo Create"/></div><div class="founder-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Hi, I’m Shawn</span><h2 class="display">Consider me your neighbor in software.</h2><p>I started Sudo Create to give creative founders and teams the kind of technical partnership I always wanted: plainspoken, curious, and personally invested in the outcome.</p><p>My background crosses music, media, design, and software. That mix helps me translate between the idea in someone’s head and the system that can make it real. The studio stays intentionally small so the person you meet is the person thinking through and building the work.</p><p>“Midwest hospitality” is more than a tone here. It means showing up prepared, making the complicated understandable, and treating your project like something entrusted—not processed.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section band"><div class="shell content-grid"><h2 class="display">The house rules.</h2><div><ul class="list-plain"><li>Listen before prescribing.</li><li>Make the work understandable.</li><li>Design for the people who will actually use it.</li><li>Build a sturdy foundation.</li><li>Leave things better than we found them.</li></ul></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
